Package: RDAforest
Title: Random forest analysis of large genomic matrices, based on
        ordination scores
Version: 2.6.9
Author: Mikhail Matz
Maintainer: Mikhail Matz <matz@utexas.edu>
Description: Identifying factors driving variation within large genomic datasets via random forest regression against their principal components. Based on gradientForest by Nick Ellis.
